producer                           → ['rejected', 'pre', 'MACHINE_NOT_ALLOWED']
code XYZ (STOPS 밖)                 → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
code CALIBRATED (상태 이름)            → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
code GENERATION (결과 뒤 멈춤)          → ['rejected', 'pre', 'GENERATION']
code OUTDIR_NOT_EMPTY (옆 기록 전용)    → ['rejected', 'pre', 'OUTDIR_NOT_EMPTY']
utc ""                             → ['rejected', 'pre', 'MACHINE_NOT_ALLOWED']
cause ""                           → ['rejected', 'pre', 'MACHINE_NOT_ALLOWED']
n 1.0                              → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
n true                             → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
n "1"                              → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
code trailing NL                   → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
code fullwidth                     → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
commit upper                       → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
dup key n (raw)                    → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
NaN cause (raw)                    → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
n 1e400 (raw → inf)                → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
BOM (raw)                          → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
hidden dir .x       → Stop ATTEMPT_LEDGER_MISMATCH
rejected.json = dir (no file) → ['interrupted', 'pre', 'parent_dead', False]
